例如，可以使用窗口函数来为每个订单分配一个序号，然后计算相邻的差值。比如：

SELECT 
    o1.id,
    o2.id,
    o1.created_at,
    o2.created_at,
    o2.created_at - o1.created_at AS interval
FROM 
    orders o1
JOIN 
    orders o2
ON 
    o2.id > o1.id
AND 
    o2.created_at > o1.created_at
ORDER BY 
    o1.id;

